      "content": "interesting. so u think the language itself makes them seem more or less honest? like, if someone speaks more informally or uses slang, does that actually make them look like they might be lying or just less observant? i'm curious if there's a specific psychological reason why a jury would trust Transcript A more than Transcript B.",
